54
00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:56.460
Vaata, vaatame, mis teha annab.
Kus sa lähed? Siit ka.

55
00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.540
Meil on vajalik Skansa vend, näed.
Kukkus alla jah? Kogu aeg,

56
00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:04.380
